**/__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# Static uploads (these should be mounted as volumes)
oneirodex/static/library/images/
oneirodex/static/library/zips/

# Runtime data — never baked into an image. `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile sends
# whatever is in the build context, so a checkout that has been RUN from (local
# `data/library`, saves, chat attachments, cheats, mods, ROM caches, client
# lifecycle/command queues, BIOS staging, generated art ...) would otherwise
# ship its owner's files in every layer. All of it is created at runtime on the
# mounted LIBRARY_HOST_PATH volume instead.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: `data/` here is the host library folder
# (LIBRARY_HOST_PATH default ./data/library). It must NOT swallow
# `oneirodex/data/`, which is package data read at runtime and has to ship.
data/
samples/free-roms/library/
# Everything under static/library is runtime state EXCEPT the two directories
# below. Excluding the parent and re-including those two (rather than listing
# each runtime folder) fails closed: a new runtime folder is kept out by default.
oneirodex/static/library/*
# Shipped art, git-tracked (`git ls-files oneirodex/static/library`). The image
# needs these. If you add another git-tracked directory under static/library,
# re-include it here or it will be missing from the image.
!oneirodex/static/library/system-marks/
!oneirodex/static/library/stock/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
